      <div class="eyebrow">Where Pinterest Actually Works</div>
      <h2>Some Businesses Have a Bigger Pinterest Opportunity Than Others.</h2>
      <p class="lede center">Pinterest is a visual planning engine, not a general marketing channel. It performs best for products people research, save, and plan around before buying &mdash; and it's a poor fit for urgent, low-visual, or impulse purchases. Here's where the data says it actually works.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-mason">
      <div class="cat-card"><div class="cat-head"><div class="cat-icon" style="background:var(--indigo);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 11.5 12 4l9 7.5"/><path d="M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5"/><path d="M9.5 20v-6h5v6"/></svg></div><span class="cat-rank">1</span></div><h4>Home Decor</h4><p>The single strongest category on Pinterest. Room decor, kitchen, and flooring searches dominate, especially around cozy spaces and seasonal styling.</p><span class="cat-stat">~79% of users engage with this category</span></div>
      <div class="cat-card"><div class="cat-head"><div class="cat-icon" style="background:var(--pink);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/><path d="M6 8h12l1.5 12h-15Z"/></svg></div><span class="cat-rank">2</span></div><h4>Fashion &amp; Accessories</h4><p>Pinterest's 4th-largest category. Outfit inspiration, seasonal trends, and styling guides generate consistently high saves.</p><span class="cat-stat">Strong evergreen search volume</span></div>
      <div class="cat-card"><div class="cat-head"><div class="cat-icon" style="background:var(--amber);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.4"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="2.4"/><path d="M8 7.5 19 18M8 16.5 19 6"/></svg></div><span class="cat-rank">3</span></div><h4>DIY &amp; Crafts</h4><p>Tutorial-driven, highly saveable content with a long shelf life &mdash; people keep returning to a good how-to Pin for months after it's published.</p><span class="cat-stat">High save-rate category</span></div>
